    "Clip generic readv copy to returned bytes; preserve unused iovec tails.",
    "SEQPACKET positional I/O returns ESPIPE.",
    "Wake connect waiters when listen backlog expands.",
    "FIONREAD rejects listeners and sums queued record bytes.",
