  ],
  "remaining_limits": [
    "Every socket descriptor passed via SCM_RIGHTS is rejected with EOPNOTSUPP, including acyclic socket graphs; ordinary files and pipes work. A global Unix-domain in-flight descriptor collector is absent.",
    "Concurrent shared-fd close is not verified or supported: existing f_get yields a borrowed fd, while blocking send/receive/accept/connect retain fd/seqpacket/condition pointers across waits. Atomic syscall-lifetime reference acquisition must be designed across socket dispatch and generic read/write paths.",
    "Autobind, full credentials/capability rules, all socket options/ioctls, signal interruption/edge-triggered epoll and stress/resource-exhaustion semantics are not fully covered.",
    "The transport uses bounded experimental buffers and is not an upstream-complete or production-ready kernel implementation.",
    "Xcode source entries are included but no Xcode build, code signing, sideload, App Store binary replacement or iPad kernel test was performed."
  ],
